{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889730/extras/79f7efd67ec34f0336ed7f9fd5aa075b.avif?t=1768461454\" width=1560 height=878 /></span> <strong>The ultimate cross-platform text-based Mafia MMO RPG.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclaim your old turf and rebuild your underworld empire in <i>Downtown Mafia</i>, a classic text-based multiplayer strategy RPG. Team up with Jane, Marco, Luke, and Big Jim to dominate the streets, recruit allies, eliminate rivals, and take over the city one turf at a time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889730/extras/3a326ab596ae8f125df0e7df671978a8.avif?t=1768461454\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 </strong> <strong>YOUR EMPIRE, YOUR RULES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addictive <strong>MMO RPG</strong> gameplay with deep strategy mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro <strong>text-based BBS style</strong> \u2013 now enhanced for modern play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross-platform empire</strong>: Play seamlessly on Steam, Android, iOS, web, and Facebook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>1.5 million downloads</strong> across platforms<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889730/extras/af24d257f17647f2bade6e7d62cacce5.avif?t=1768461454\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd76\ufe0f BECOME A LEGENDARY MOBSTER</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your class: <strong>Hustler, Runner, or Fighter</strong> \u2013 build your own crime story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete story-driven <strong>assignments and missions</strong> in cities worldwide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight players across platforms in <strong>real-time PvP</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add enemies to your <strong>Hit List</strong> and exact revenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat bosses, <strong>recruit them as mercs</strong>, and expand your empire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up, earn skill points, and unlock <strong>new weapons, vehicles, armor</strong>, and properties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your <strong>Crime Family</strong> close and your <strong>Rival List</strong> closer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889730/extras/b6624a6d20f6b0d91e97e2dcd6895e01.avif?t=1768461454\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2b BUILD YOUR CRIME EMPIRE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and manage <strong>lucrative businesses and properties</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and upgrade over <strong>100+ powerful weapons and gear</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>special assignments</strong> to earn rare items and unlock new content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain <strong>reputation and achievements</strong> for your criminal feats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in <strong>seasonal events and weekly tournaments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/889730/extras/dbb20651e0de255d5418ec5f2f5111d7.avif?t=1768461454\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc80 JOIN THE GANG WAR\u2122</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create 